# Copy to .env in the repo root (gitignored, never committed) and fill in.
# scripts/dev.sh loads .env into every service's window, so any DSVIEW_*
# setting from config/settings.py can go here too.
#
# Telegram bot (alerts/telegram_bot.py):
#   1. In Telegram, message @BotFather, send /newbot, and follow its steps.
#      It replies with the bot's token: that's DSVIEW_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN.
#   2. Open a chat with your new bot and send it anything (a bot can't
#      message someone who hasn't messaged it first).
#   3. Your chat id: with the token in TOKEN, run
#        curl -s "https://api.telegram.org/bot$TOKEN/getUpdates"
#      and read result[0].message.chat.id. That's DSVIEW_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.
DSVIEW_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
DSVIEW_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
